---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About NepalRanks | Our Editorial Process"
  description="How NepalRanks researches, tests and ranks products and services in Nepal — our methodology, independence and affiliate disclosure."
>
  <article class="nr-prose py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">About NepalRanks</h1>
    <div class="nr-article mt-6">
      <p>
        NepalRanks publishes independent buying guides and rankings for products and services
        in Nepal. Our goal is simple: help you make a confident buying decision without wading
        through marketing noise.
      </p>

      <h2>How we research</h2>
      <p>Every guide is built on a consistent process:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Market scan.</strong> We identify the models and providers actually available in Nepal.</li>
        <li><strong>Specification comparison.</strong> We normalise specs so like-for-like comparisons are possible.</li>
        <li><strong>Hands-on and owner research.</strong> We combine our own testing with verified owner reports.</li>
        <li><strong>Local context.</strong> Price, import duty, service network and after-sales support all count.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>
        Rankings are never sold. Advertisers and affiliate partners have no say in placement,
        scoring or editorial opinion.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links to retailers may be affiliate links. If you buy through them we may earn a
        small commission at no extra cost to you. This never influences our rankings.
      </p>

      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        Prices and availability in Nepal change frequently. If you spot an error, please
        <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> and we will correct it promptly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
